The dev server process cleanup and Next.js dev indicator badge suppression are now implemented in [capture.mjs](file://$HOME/.claude/worktrees/mothers-love-video-audio/scripts/video/capture.mjs).

The script now spawns the dev server detached and terminates the full process group on exit, error, or SIGINT with SIGTERM and a 2-second fallback to SIGKILL if the port still answers. Every recorded page also injects an early style to hide `nextjs-portal` before navigation.

